{
  "slug": "anakin-claude-plugin",
  "name": "Anakin Claude Plugin",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Anakin turns any website into clean, LLM-ready data directly from Claude Code. Scrape single pages or batch up to 10 URLs at once, returning markdown, JSON, or raw output. Run AI-powered web searches to find pages and sources instantly. Launch deep agentic research that autonomously explores the web and synthesizes comprehensive reports with cited sources. All output is saved to files to keep your context window clean. Supports headless browser rendering for JavaScript-heavy sites, geo...",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**, **1 agent** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `anakin-cli` (Anakin provides fast, accurate, LLM-optimized web data extraction via the anakin-cli), `deep-research` (Run a deep agentic research task using anakin-cli that autonomously explores the web and returns a comprehensive report), `scrape-batch` (Scrape up to 10 URLs at once using anakin-cli and return combined results in a single output file), `scrape-website` (Scrape a single URL using anakin-cli and return clean markdown, structured JSON, or the full raw API response), `search-web` (Run an AI-powered web search using anakin-cli and return relevant results instantly), `setup` (Check Anakin CLI installation, configure API key, and set up the output directory)\n- **Agents** (1): `data-extraction-architect` (Data extraction specialist that should be used proactively when planning which anakin-cli commands and strategy to use for…)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PreToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install anakin-claude-plugin@claude-community` from `Anakin-Inc/anakin-claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 6,
    "agent": 1,
    "hook": 1
  },
